{
  "rc": {
    "_note": "实时 · 22(2026-10-11):大数 = 并行(运行中 + 等你授权 + 等你输入,不含搁置 / 断开 / 已结束,§1.4);下两行 = 在跑 / 等授权 / 等你,有人在等时第二行变黄。\n三种没数据分开说:没接上(--)/ 接上了没开同步(提示怎么开)/ 开了但没会话(0)。",
    "i18n": {
      "zh-CN": {
        "title": "实时",
        "empty": "等待首次同步",
        "asof": "截至 ",
        "off": "还没打开同步",
        "offHint": "在 Claude Code 里运行 /numable-usage，说「打开实时会话并同步到手机」",
        "none": "没有在跑的会话",
        "par": "路并行",
        "proj": " 个工程",
        "run": " 在跑",
        "perm": " 等授权",
        "input": " 等你"
      },
      "en-US": {
        "title": "Live",
        "empty": "Not synced yet",
        "asof": "As of ",
        "off": "Sync is off",
        "offHint": "In Claude Code, run /numable-usage and ask to turn on live sessions with sync",
        "none": "Nothing running",
        "par": "active",
        "proj": " projects",
        "run": " running",
        "perm": " approval",
        "input": " waiting"
      }
    },
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": "bg",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "linear(#FFFFFF\\,#FDFBFA\\,#FBF3F1)@90|linear(#15171A\\,#1A1A1C\\,#221E1F)@90",
        "_note": "实时 · 22(2026-10-11):大数 = 并行(运行中 + 等你授权 + 等你输入,不含搁置 / 断开 / 已结束,§1.4);下两行 = 在跑 / 等授权 / 等你,有人在等时第二行变黄。"
      },
      {
        "_note": "源色身份点:本包统一用 Claude 暖橙两档。",
        "id": "dot",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "12pt",
        "y": "{ttl.y}+({ttl.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        },
        "bgColor": "#C15F3C|#E8916B"
      },
      {
        "id": "ttl",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "21pt",
        "y": "11pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-92pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "${@i18n.title}",
        "fontSize": "13pt",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "typeface": "System-Bold"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(if::(eq::(connect::(k,${w.devs}),k),0,1),1),if::(gt::(${w.devs},0),1,0),0),1),if::(eq::(${w.has},1),1,0),0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "big",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}*0.24",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${w.n.par}",
            "fontSize": "30pt",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold"
          },
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}*0.24+38pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.par} · ${w.n.proj}${@i18n.proj}",
            "fontSize": "10pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "maxLines": "1"
          },
          {
            "type": "path",
            "x": "12pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}-40pt",
            "w": "8pt",
            "h": "9pt",
            "d": "M0 0 L8 4.5 L0 9 Z",
            "viewBox": "0 0 8 9",
            "scaleType": "fitXY",
            "fillColor": "#C15F3C|#E8916B"
          },
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "24pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}-42pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-36pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${w.n.run}${@i18n.run}",
            "fontSize": "11pt",
            "textColor": "#C15F3C|#E8916B",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold"
          },
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}-24pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "⚠ ${w.n.perm}${@i18n.perm} · ${w.n.input}${@i18n.input}",
            "fontSize": "11pt",
            "textColor": "$[if::(gt::(${w.n.wait},0),#C98A00|#F5C242,#6B7280|#8E939B)]",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(if::(eq::(connect::(k,${w.devs}),k),0,1),1),if::(gt::(${w.devs},0),1,0),0),1),if::(eq::(${w.has},0),1,0),0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}*0.24",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "0",
            "fontSize": "30pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold"
          },
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}*0.24+38pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.none}",
            "fontSize": "10pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "maxLines": "1"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(connect::(k,${w.devs}),k),0,1),1),if::(eq::(${w.devs},0),1,0),0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}*0.30",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.off}",
            "fontSize": "13pt",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold"
          },
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}*0.30+20pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.offHint}",
            "fontSize": "9pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "maxLines": "4"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(if::(eq::(connect::(k,${w.devs}),k),0,1),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}*0.24+9pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "--",
            "fontSize": "30pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_note": "时效锚:右上角、与卡名同一基线、9pt、右对齐(卡片设计系统 §3)。写数据时刻不写「现在」(§5.5)。",
        "id": "at",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "12pt",
        "y": "14pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "$[if::(eq::(connect::(k,${at}),k),${@i18n.empty},${@i18n.asof}${at})]",
        "fontSize": "9pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "alignmentH": "2"
      }
    ]
  }
}